<div class="personal-projects-bg-img">
  <h1>PC Building</h1>
</div>
<div class="container page-content">
  <h2>Components Assembled</h2>
  <p>
    One of the most fun activities I enjoy jumping on is the chance to build a
    computer either for myself or for someone else. Any time I am asked if I can
    help someone with building a computer, the answer is always yes!
  </p>
  <p>
    To some people, building a computer can be overwhelming or scary so if
    someone asks me for assistance on building a computer, I try to walk them
    through the process instead of doing it myself. That way they can see how
    fun the process can be and eliminate the fears they had going into the
    process.
  </p>
  <p>
    Below are pictures I have saved from computers I have built or helped build.
    Side note, excuse the clutter in the background on some of these pictures… I
    worked on those computers at my parent’s dining area. 😊
  </p>
